  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Humanitarian 2 Humanitarian</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">H2H is a Non-Governmental Organisation registered in Geneva and hosted by the Danish Refugee Council (DRC). The H2H Network comprises approximately 60 humanitarian service providers, supported by a Secretariat which provides a convening function and platform for sharing resources. The H2H Fund is managed by the Secretariat and offers a unique capability to quickly disburse grants to network members in response to a rapid onset crisis or spike in a protracted context. Its members configure their expertise to emerging crises and it is therefore extremely responsive and flexible.</narrative>
  </description>
